## Hard Rules

- Notes-vault control files are authoritative.
- Keep `STATE.md` and `TASKS.md` short.
- Move open/deferred work to `<NOTES_VAULT_PATH>/projects/<PROJECT_NAME>/tasks/backlog.md`, plans to `<NOTES_VAULT_PATH>/projects/<PROJECT_NAME>/tasks/audits/`, completed work to `<NOTES_VAULT_PATH>/projects/<PROJECT_NAME>/tasks/archive/YYYY-MM-done.md`, and session history to `<NOTES_VAULT_PATH>/projects/<PROJECT_NAME>/sessions/`.
- Use normal work for small safe tasks. Use `tasks/audits/` only when work needs a review gate: risky changes, broad refactors, parallel Codex/Claude work, PR/version/deploy coordination, data or money impact, or anything where one agent should review before another implements. Plans with `status: review-needed` must not be implemented until reviewed.
- Work in `.worktrees/<task>/`, never the main checkout.
- Branch from `origin/<DEFAULT_BRANCH>`, not local `<DEFAULT_BRANCH>`.
- Never touch another agent's branch, worktree, or PR.
- Bump `VERSION` only with `scripts/claim_version.ps1`; update `CHANGELOG.md` in the same commit.
- Verify before claiming done.
